perience that places you in the heart of the enchanting \"Lakkurna Cove\". Fictionally known for its epic sunsets and perfect, crystalline waters, Lakkurna is also home to a reclusive fishing community said to keep guard over the Cove's more magical spots.  Impress the locals and gain access to every area within this 500-meter cove. \nWhether you're playing in auto-acceleration mode to carve out and explore the cove or in \"physical mode\" to burn off today's caloric surplus, you'll always have a set-up that matches your needs.\nAdditionally, VirtuaFoil: Lakkurna Cove also features a stellar soundtrack and an adjustable time-of-day function that locks-in the tone.\nDon't forget to send postcards!", "short_description": "Hop on your hydrofoil, set-up your ride-style and carve the waters of the legendary Lakkurna Cove!"}]}, "developer_name": "Tristan John", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tristan-john.com/Privacy/VFLakkurnaCove/index.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tristan John", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tristan-john.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25461535416803375"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1641051483804690"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "12583